          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures TigerVNC Viewer preferences from HKCU\\Software\\TigerVNC\\vncviewer (connection defaults, display/encoding options, UI behaviour). Saved VNC password is documented in secrets and excluded from auto-restore. HKCU-only capture. Confidence: medium — registry path inferred from TigerVNC source and community reports; no official backup documentation exists. Authored secret warning: TigerVNC Viewer may store a saved VNC password as an obfuscated value under HKCU\\Software\\TigerVNC\\vncviewer\\Password. While TigerVNC uses a fixed XOR obfuscation key (not machine-bound), auto-restoring saved passwords is inadvisable — re-enter the password after a rebuild. Authored excluded secret or machine-bound paths: HKCU\\Software\\TigerVNC\\vncviewer\\Password"
